222
00:18:51,180 --> 00:18:52,300
We're still looking at DOT.

223
00:18:53,040 --> 00:18:56,600
We did some more kind of research now,

224
00:18:56,680 --> 00:19:04,120
and it appears that there is an existing DOT permit where we show the driveway for the residents.

225
00:19:04,940 --> 00:19:09,460
I think it was going to be there when it was going to be church activities.

226
00:19:09,460 --> 00:19:11,480
Yeah, so we're in the process of preparing the...

227
00:19:11,480 --> 00:19:13,440
All right, so they're all in the works.

228
00:19:13,620 --> 00:19:13,820
Yes.

229
00:19:13,940 --> 00:19:18,560
All right, and they're listed here in my remarks what the four permits are.

230
00:19:18,840 --> 00:19:22,580
There's two DOT permits, one for the driveway, for the dwelling,

231
00:19:22,980 --> 00:19:27,900
and then modification of Dave's other property at 323,

232
00:19:28,320 --> 00:19:32,380
so that the common curb cut for both commercial buildings, right?

233
00:19:32,760 --> 00:19:36,320
And then water and septum are the other two.

234
00:19:36,320 --> 00:19:44,480
So, top of page two, ask us a question.

235
00:19:44,880 --> 00:19:50,320
Has Mike submitted written comments on this?

236
00:19:50,360 --> 00:19:53,440
Mike Devine submitted comments on this application at all?

237
00:19:55,020 --> 00:19:55,840
