241
00:19:59,560 --> 00:20:03,740
So, I guess that's out there.

242
00:20:05,440 --> 00:20:07,980
Three is a procedure I recommend every time.

243
00:20:08,140 --> 00:20:10,560
It's the performance guarantee.

244
00:20:12,020 --> 00:20:19,040
It would be a condition of any approval granted for installation and maintenance of erosion and sedimentation controls throughout construction,

245
00:20:19,040 --> 00:20:27,420
site stabilization in the event of abandonment, and full and final installation of lawn and landscaping, right there, shown on the plan.

246
00:20:27,420 --> 00:20:45,860
Zoning matters, comment, Tom has addressed this to the extent that he has confirmed availability of 1,458 gallons a day.

247
00:20:45,860 --> 00:20:56,680
