248
00:20:56,680 --> 00:21:09,020
The one thing I was asking is, is that, I guess it would be the lot loading calculations on the cover sheet to the left that indicate what the actual proposed lot loading is.

249
00:21:09,160 --> 00:21:16,320
I think you just did that verbally, and I caught that it's 128 gallons less than the maximum, I think is what you said.

250
