992
01:02:53,100 --> 01:02:56,480
I think, you know, she's, you've got a good attorney, take her advice.

993
01:02:56,900 --> 01:03:01,940
I think it's inconsequential, and I think she'll come back with that and tell you who that is,

994
01:03:01,940 --> 01:03:05,040
